      "source_text": "通过大喊Wasshoi的声音来确认状态",
      "source_fingerprint": "dfe8dd243ff97574c6edbd6e33e479e44d793f9d809e9d5672ec2368d3f8c44c",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "260",
        "1068"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3ce1570366bf720f8eb63da0",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "跟训练员一起喊『千代王・喔ー！』",
      "source_fingerprint": "d982201c5539fdedcc88e5fdaa35d6e561f1dae4504ea3212df62e44c9a18be1",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "260",
        "1069"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5b678e9859187322cfcd2d26",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "猛地一跃而起彷佛要把地板踢翻",
      "source_fingerprint": "47df2f645febdca010caeb5a6d2c9e6b208903f31e4dc9741cb027de6abc84a8",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "260",
        "1070"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8e0d0d161961dceab6e9afa0",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "和训练员一起喝具有安神效果的茶",
      "source_fingerprint": "8a371cf1ef413621993618d33c5c4771b7d3f5d553e186c90e250b1d71bc16e6",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "260",
        "1071"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c3f5091895b88edcd3c4ed61",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "必须先行一礼再进入赛场",
      "source_fingerprint": "112baa6ee57ecaa3b067eb856cb6f232e207edba1888d98c1b4d1a4d2edfb706",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "260",
        "1072"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7eda988e5faf9ca97312e324",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "向隔壁闸选手问好并自我介绍",
      "source_fingerprint": "38bc2f84390188c44e6e4a5a18c53ab1d74a90f947f4f6662944323187f9e5b3",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "260",
        "1074"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8beb4538465bbf4c2bf1f3d4",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "正是在面临严酷战斗的日子，才更要扬起嘴角",
      "source_fingerprint": "e6eb421d9ee0a67420f6718d24cf1029f85ade3868d842de65f61b9e693632d7",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "260",
        "1076"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7fe993f52d9756748a81f344",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "会在地下通道精神满满地向大家打招呼",
      "source_fingerprint": "5e83ce6b3d68471dc89e646ce27e5805379b6632a377d0b7d04b4c1870f52433",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "260",
        "1077"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:531413d0e8aa33ab6b58222f",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "会乘着赛场的风随心所欲地起舞",
      "source_fingerprint": "587eacd31a2d2e276a11af4b2d74d88e8fcdc8b0023e2b609c97611ec114b223",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "260",
        "1078"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2b366805a4f381558f7a8938",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "刷刷决胜服！总之先把静电去掉",
      "source_fingerprint": "11f93ab705e7cce95fa7638086954812da0d28b18f3fe5c82bcc29089bba74bd",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "260",
        "1080"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c4576ec51e5b9dfd36ce9277",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "想象着飞上天空，穿过云朵形成的圆环",
      "source_fingerprint": "a814f24948db2b9e677497ce23e3334c35e15efa827cf73c746c0b701e1452a9",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "260",
        "1082"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d0596d2c5527c0c2f0b8181b",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "只喝常温的水，不让身体着凉",
      "source_fingerprint": "c71bc70a78aab648dae3ff17bed5c20304e3a060561514274782949c90c217f5",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "260",
        "1083"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ea39bc0557d755bd4cd709cc",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "穿透虚空——（※空气栅栏破坏）",
      "source_fingerprint": "a9e315696e881759ca2bd5c16feb9d5025bdce34f9fd423f127616e258abe012",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "260",
        "1084"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ed409a30b7dff27e11f2ee44",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "吟诵家族的玉条，再次明确自己肩负的责任",
      "source_fingerprint": "80359eb946917218608aaf440cdaa90970156655c23f4d8fa463ea0f71d27948",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "260",
        "1085"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5d6050cd2e825b4ddffec149",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "呼吸深到能听见吐息声",
      "source_fingerprint": "e06fdf84a611284a87161b4622236393360ddb2078bd35e3edba731ad797a0d3",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "260",
        "1086"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:514ac9539b2927f5412f7af0",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "用语音备忘录记录赛前的小真",
      "source_fingerprint": "5429d76a5631f35c4ccc4334e12243f5a30c2753c30e51e81e9b24173efc81ce",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "260",
        "1087"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3f99e3e90d588ee0a13c209d",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "温煦腹部、按压合谷穴、点上茉莉香",
      "source_fingerprint": "9862606607d320fd20d4885381ae717fedeb4128a51f801abac019e483d420d2",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "260",
        "1088"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:71861401beb8585feee44c94",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "面向墙壁集中精神",
      "source_fingerprint": "62686fa4a4ae7a0b3f1524f9a300fce742981ce6c7ecbaaa4775f9edf3bab283",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "260",
        "1089"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8b4012ac849c96051437e3fd",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在镜子前检查心中的悸动☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "29b8fbefe2b5be4fc57decf957213bb667a553b97675a557275d835f5dc88b53",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "260",
        "1091"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e1e291c4b3d7368b73f5f0cb",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "走出休息室前会说『谢谢』",
      "source_fingerprint": "c5f6fba8416583c112bb9053718fe21af9abd19c4d988b1a4725367efcaa329e",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "260",
        "1093"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5830eda2851d309d119d71c0",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "想象着从密林一跃而出，奔向荒野",
      "source_fingerprint": "3160f666d0db36eb4d841cf1b8e1b12cd763aeb4b6b70d0e8f5331cf539df5e0",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "260",
        "1094"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d90affc3f5b2d715b700085e",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "从应援歌中获取快乐☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "f76e062b5ce80f87c2271ff22d583cfbaf83a916b916550856ebd9449e0c379a",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "260",
        "1098"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d6822436821fd18f3557840a",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "小声哼唱原创应援歌曲",
      "source_fingerprint": "d18013f22b0a6c582a128e98f34fdeddcafe7bb64ead784e0ade266195be6cb6",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "260",
        "1099"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5a2b0f3961cbb5693c4c7311",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "为避免走形，会调整决胜服的腰围",
      "source_fingerprint": "1619f7818d7c1ca780ee3a67972251303ed434d1e1d405015d7b18bb644a0672",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "260",
        "1100"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4ab7b8e12106d9ac5c7167e9",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "作为演奏者的礼仪，会整理出最美丽的仪态",
      "source_fingerprint": "ee5761515544797fee5bfe9ef3b89f377da04830a40f221ee7ac7f1f24ae053c",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "260",
        "1102"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:419f56e845745127ac4373cf",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "用拳头刺向眼前看不见的墙壁",
      "source_fingerprint": "f197dd942dc878bc17e00e8c69496f228f2092dd2d4d0bb0a0c21238d7f6a1d0",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "260",
        "1104"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:792684b643a216e6368c1cf5",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "『相信』“同调”",
      "source_fingerprint": "78e1dfeacbe0728e24ab0f0ebda63bea434e9ff2883aba59da0b7199b7de5e05",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "260",
        "1105"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:282b0735d175cf7372cd203b",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "会忍不住和前一天的人气作比较",
      "source_fingerprint": "bda9ad1f5c302cb2d5b122c4d0025934d7b0513c537ecdaba426987c61e1c9fc",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "260",
        "1106"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0b1b009712cf68b40ea3549d",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "当然是跳踢踏舞！",
      "source_fingerprint": "efad4f53aedd8c43a939c3593a5b7aea03994d13fb613584345c20f4ddd2a16c",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "260",
        "1107"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:49f6954726e5fdd39111b222",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "让决胜服也晒足日光浴，充满能量",
      "source_fingerprint": "5f26a8c385674f351f535516945cae8557bf081322f1f9f9c3656289b18fe114",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "260",
        "1109"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3f17119e4d58cd5aa4f9fc1a",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "将心路历程详细记录以便传承给后辈",
      "source_fingerprint": "4dd35d6327d5df2262db8945616afbbc8cb39f7cb34a75b3bf5b9302abbe8240",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "260",
        "1110"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b5f18dfbb4e72878a111f75e",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "喷洒一点最喜欢的古龙水",
      "source_fingerprint": "83100c1bf85e33a26a09350d3b8c2a7d91388b90c195b2240889818c1e6d19cf",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "260",
        "1116"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
